  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760355,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Lamer Compo: A Commodore 64 Comedy of Errors\n\nStep into the wonderfully chaotic world of *1st Lamer Compo*, a hilariously unconventional football management game for the Commodore 64! Forget tactical brilliance and strategic signings – here, you're in charge of the *worst* team imaginable, and your goal isn't glory, but survival (and maybe a few laughs along the way).\n\nRecruit a ragtag squad of utterly incompetent players, each with their own bizarre quirks and limitations. Expect missed passes, own goals, and a general air of bewildered incompetence on the pitch. The gameplay is a quirky blend of simplified management and unpredictable match simulation, where luck and sheer desperation often outweigh skill. \n\nBetween matches, manage your meager finances, deal with increasingly ridiculous player demands, and try to keep your sanity intact. *1st Lamer Compo* isn't about winning; it's about embracing the absurdity and enjoying the spectacular failures. Prepare for a uniquely funny and frustrating experience – you'll be laughing *with* and *at* your team in equal measure!"
    },
